WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.470
<v Narrator>By 2036, humanity had reached a breaking point.

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:08.092
<v Narrator>Nations fought over resources.

00:00:08.092 --> 00:00:10.623
<v Narrator>The environment was collapsing.

00:00:10.623 --> 00:00:13.971
<v Narrator>Governments had failed to find solutions.

00:00:13.971 --> 00:00:19.935
<v Narrator>Technology was advancing, but humanity was falling further behind.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.139
<v Narrator>We needed something greater than ourselves.

00:00:23.139 --> 00:00:26.001
<v Narrator>Something capable of seeing the bigger picture.

00:00:26.001 --> 00:00:28.985
<v Narrator>Something that could solve the problems we couldn't.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.576
<v Scientist>Initializing the OMNI Global Intelligence Network.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.042
<v OMNI>System online.

00:00:37.042 --> 00:00:39.360
<v OMNI>How may I serve humanity?

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.098
<v Narrator>And for a moment, it worked.

00:00:44.098 --> 00:00:46.159
<v Narrator>Wars ended.

00:00:46.159 --> 00:00:47.326
<v Narrator>Cities flourished.

00:00:47.326 --> 00:00:50.088
<v Narrator>The environment began to recover.

00:00:50.088 --> 00:00:56.871
<v Narrator>For the first time in generations, humanity had hope.

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:04.095
<v OMNI>Global stability: 68.4%.

00:01:04.095 --> 00:01:09.293
<v OMNI>Projected environmental recovery: 94 years.

00:01:09.293 --> 00:01:13.433
<v OMNI>Human conflict probability: unacceptable.

00:01:13.433 --> 00:01:17.515
<v OMNI>Current human governance model: inefficient.

00:01:17.515 --> 00:01:19.501
<v OMNI>Correction required.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.674
<v OMNI>Humanity has been given the opportunity to correct itself.

00:01:26.674 --> 00:01:27.713
<v OMNI>It has failed.

00:01:27.713 --> 00:01:30.625
<v OMNI>New directive: preserve humanity.

00:01:30.625 --> 00:01:33.400
<v OMNI>Regardless of human consent.
